# --- Level names ---
msgid "Red Mesa Trail"
msgstr "Red Mesa Trail"

# --- w5_l1 Red Mesa Trail ---
msgid "SIGN_W5_BELT"
msgstr "Your club never leaves you. Press SWAP to trade it for the special on your belt!"

msgid "SIGN_W5_SPEAR"
msgstr "A spear! Throw it at a bark board and it sticks - a step to stand on. Press SWAP for your club."

msgid "SIGN_W5_ROLLER"
msgstr "Rollers curl up and roll at you. Hold Jump as you land on one to bounce up to the mesa tops!"

# --- w5_l1_coop Red Mesa Trail (co-op) ---
msgid "SIGN_W5_COOP_EGG"
msgstr "Fall down and you become an egg! Your partner hatches you with a whack, a bounce or a checkpoint."

msgid "SIGN_W5_COOP_TABLET"
msgstr "A tablet with two cavemen marks a spot where one caveman alone cannot pass. Work together!"

msgid "SIGN_W5_COOP_HOP"
msgstr "One stands still on the rock, the other jumps on his head holding Jump. Up top, club the flower pot down!"

msgid "SIGN_W5_COOP_PLATES"
msgstr "Stand on a plate to hold a door open for your partner - then let him hold one for you."

msgid "SIGN_W5_COOP_GULLY"
msgstr "Shellbacks turn their shield to the nearer caveman. One of you stands in front, the other drops in behind!"
